%% One orchestrated run, end to end — the seven steps from design/architecture.md §06
%% Render: mermaid.live | VS Code Mermaid preview

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SCH as Cloud Scheduler
    participant WF as Workflows
    participant RUN as Cloud Run<br/>extractor
    participant SRC as Sheets / Drive
    participant GCS as GCS archive
    participant BQ as BigQuery
    participant DF as Dataform
    participant OPS as ops.*
    participant N as Alerting

    SCH->>WF: trigger (dataset, schedule)
    WF->>OPS: INSERT run_log (load_id, started_at)

    rect rgba(29, 148, 130, 0.07)
    note over RUN,GCS: Step 2 — extract, with schema evolution
    WF->>RUN: extract(source_id, load_id)
    RUN->>SRC: read declared tabs / ranges
    SRC-->>RUN: rows + observed header
    RUN->>GCS: archive original bytes (immutable)
    RUN->>OPS: lookup schema_registry (fingerprint)
    alt fingerprint known
        OPS-->>RUN: known version — no evolution
    else new fingerprint
        RUN->>RUN: classify changes → AUTO / PROPOSE / BLOCK
        RUN->>OPS: INSERT schema_evolution_log
        opt any BLOCK
            RUN-->>WF: fail before writing a single row
            WF->>N: alert contract owner by name
        end
    end
    end

    rect rgba(29, 148, 130, 0.07)
    note over RUN,BQ: Step 3 — load (idempotent)
    RUN->>BQ: DELETE partition WHERE load_id = @load_id
    RUN->>BQ: INSERT landing.raw_* (canonical cols + _raw JSON)
    RUN->>OPS: INSERT dq_results (validator outcome)
    end

    WF->>DF: run tagged workflow (staging → core → marts)
    DF->>BQ: build models + inline assertions
    alt blocking assertion fails in core
        DF-->>WF: fail — published state untouched
        WF->>N: alert data engineering
    else assertions pass
        DF-->>WF: ok
    end

    rect rgba(190, 113, 52, 0.07)
    note over WF,OPS: Step 6 — reconcile against the frozen baseline
    WF->>BQ: run generic diff (grain + tolerance from contract)
    BQ->>OPS: INSERT recon_results (match_rate, variances)
    alt match_rate below threshold
        WF->>N: variance report to owning analyst
    end
    end

    WF->>BQ: swap authorized views to new version
    WF->>OPS: UPDATE run_log (finished_at, status)
    WF->>N: run summary to team channel
